WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:12.480
Well, money is something that right now is a foundation, a foundation for human living and survival.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:22.820
There are people who say money isn't everything, but you know that to live at peace with everything you need a good economy.

00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:32.599
And when I talk about a good economy, I don't mean being a millionaire, being rich, but being able to flow economically.

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:44.720
Like I was saying earlier, when you start working on a project that is yourself, in my case, art, music, or film,

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:56.180
you have to work on yourself, on your project, on what you want, so that it later becomes something reciprocal, you know?

00:00:58.360 --> 00:01:04.019
You work with that and for that, and then that gives you a result.

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:09.520
Music gives you back all those sacrifices you made at some point,

00:01:10.240 --> 00:01:39.040
when you sang on the street, when you sang on buses, when you sang on corners, when you sang in restaurants, well, later on you get bigger stages, you get another kind of, let's say, social classes that pay a lot more than what you're used to, so you realize that, well, it was worth it, that it's all been work, a process that's mostly personal, being able to grow so that this comes back to you, so money isn't the most important thing,

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:40.660
but it is something very essential.
